# EvolveAgent UI system (post-redesign)

## Platforms

- Web and desktop share **one** React tree under `frontend/`.
- At boot, `frontend/src/main.jsx` sets `data-platform="web"` or `data-platform="desktop"` (Tauri detect).
- Tokens live in `frontend/src/styles/ea-theme.css`. Prefer CSS vars / `ea-*` classes over hardcoded dark glass or cyan/purple glow.

| | Web | Desktop (Tauri) |
|---|---|---|
| Feel | Light, calm, airy productivity | Darker, denser command center |
| Do not | Copy desktop dark look onto web | Copy the light web look onto desktop |

Desktop has **no separate frontend**. Differentiate via tokens + `desktop/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` (window, overlay title bar, traffic lights). See `docs/FRONTEND_DESKTOP_UI.md`.

## Shell files

- `frontend/src/App.tsx` — active shell (not legacy `App.jsx`)
- `frontend/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx` — sectioned nav, token surfaces
- `frontend/src/components/layout/TopBar.tsx` — quiet productivity header (search, refresh, live, health). Avoid mode-tab / glow chrome unless requested.

## Shared surfaces

Use / extend these instead of inventing new dark glass:

- `GlassCard`, `MetricCard`, `PageHero`, badges, `Toast`, `CommandModal`, `LiveWorkingCard`
- `frontend/src/components/ui/*` → `ea-card` / `ea-btn` / `ea-chip`

Avoid: purple/cyan glow gradients, blur orbs, neon badges, `bg-[#0a0a0a]` / `bg-[#171717]` / `border-white/10` patterns on new work.

## UX priorities

- Clarity and spacing over decoration
- Preserve functionality
- Keep Simple Mode clean; technical detail only in Developer Mode / details panels
